.TH PRINTAFM 1 "18 Sept 2024" 10.04.0 Ghostscript \" -*- nroff -*-
.SH "نام (NAME)"
printafm \- Print the metrics from a Postscript font in AFM format using ghostscript
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBprintafm\fR \fIfontname\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
This script invokes
.BR gs (1)
to print the metrics from a font in AFM format.
Output goes to stdout.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBgs\fR(1)
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
This document was last revised for Ghostscript version 10.04.0.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Artifex Software, Inc. are the
primary maintainers of Ghostscript.
This manpage by George Ferguson.
